Package: homelab-web-proxy
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nginx, certbot, python3-certbot-nginx, adduser
Description: nginx reverse-proxy + TLS vhosts for the Homelab-api web family
 Scoped only to Roundcube/homelab-api/homelab-drive-web-ui/homelab-sso-ui
 subdomains -- one package-owned file per vhost in sites-available, never
 touching any other site already on a shared host. TLS certs are
 obtained via certbot only if not already present.
